# Test package of the st branch (tools/testpaket.py on main; format in its
# header).
#
#   Test     number from the test list (docs/05c-ST.md; until main is
#            merged in, docs/05 of this worktree)
#   Machine  falcon, st or beide
#   Source   relative to the root of this worktree
#   Name     8.3, lands in AMBFILES\ beside the game data; - for a folder,
#            which is laid over the root of ATARI\ (the whole build)
#
# Whoever puts a test here leaves its build in place until the date;
# afterwards the lines go.

# The whole ATARI/ of this worktree is not laid over main's: it carries
# older Falcon programs.  The ST engine goes under its own name instead and
# is started directly; the game files are the same as main's.
